  "description": "The Bruce is uncompromisingly designed for slopestyle, dirt and pump track. Its direct, balanced handling gives you confidence from the very first moment – for clean lines, controlled landings and smooth sessions. The combination of Maxxis Ikon at the front and Maxxis DTH at the rear ensures secure grip, fast directional changes and a predictable ride feel on changing surfaces. Stable, intuitive and precisely tuned so that you can concentrate fully on flow, timing and style. The setup is rounded off by selected ROSE components for the handlebars, stem and grips, which ensure a clean look and a direct, secure cockpit. Clear shapes and reliable ergonomics enable quick reactions with full control. The saddle and seat post from SDG complement the bike with proven comfort and robust workmanship, so that even longer sessions or hard landings are no problem. approx. 11.3 kg, may vary by up to +/- 5 % due to manufacturing tolerances, weight for absolute black frame, size M, without pedals",
